e.sh:22-29), with Cargo.lock/package-lock pinned via --locked/npm ci. CHANGELOG 0.2.0 claims spot-verified against shipped code (create_grant/create_approval daemon/src/nemesis_core_daemon.adb:257,294; parent.grant/approval-<digest>.apr daemon/src/nemesis-core-authority_store.adb:51-59; protocol doc protocols/local-core-v1.md:12-19,58-62; 81 obligations in committed FORMAL_KERNEL.json:243; scripts/verify_authority_aba.py present). GAPS: stale living-doc claims that still call signing/notarization prerequisites and TS blockers unresolved (DCO-01, medium); the install gate never hash-binds the predecessor and does not bind the successor path to a SHA256SUMS entry before extract+execute (DCO-02, medium); dead symlink refusal after .resolve() (DCO-03, low); receipt hardcodes no_launchd_jobs/no_privileged_helpers and records but does not enforce version distinctness (DCO-04, low); residual inventory omits writes into the user workspace repository (worktree registration + nemesis/desktop-* branch) so the 'never writes outside' sentence overclaims (DCO-05, low). Historical archives (TS-PROPOSAL.md, archived review JSONs, the 2026-08-21 mission contract, TS continuation contract) retain pre-epoch wording by design and were not counted as gaps. Full brief-schema result follows verbatim.

